@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "已预约" as Booked
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "已到诊" as Arrived
state "未到" as Missed
[*] --> Booked : 确认安排\n[日期资源有效且无冲突]\n/ 关联有效占用
Booked : 变更或取消安排 [选择改约且新资源有效]\n/ 保留原安排并调整占用
Booked --> Cancelled : 变更或取消安排\n[选择取消且未到诊]\n/ 释放占用并保留原因
Booked --> Arrived : 关联到诊结果\n[当日且无已有就诊]\n/ 关联唯一就诊
Booked --> Missed : 确认未到事实\n[已过计划且人工核实未到]\n/ 保留未到依据

@enduml
